[42.113748, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;78H\u001b[1K\rthe artifacts)\r\n[demo] built fakeagent, worker, drive, inspect into out/bin\u001b[19X\r\n[demo] dev server healthy on 127.0.0.1:7244 (Web UI http://127.0.0.1:8244)\u001b[4X\u001b[5;78H\u001b[1K\r\n=========================================================================\u001b[5X\r\n[demo] ARM: mid-execute -- Worker killed while the agent is working; the retry\u001b[8;78H\u001b[1K\r resumes from the checkpoint\r\n[demo] mid-execute: workflow bead-orchestration/demo-city/worker-kill-demo/wor\u001b[10;78H\u001b[1K\rk-item-1\r\n[demo] mid-execute: activity formula/demo-root/edit-file.author/g1 (stable acr\u001b[12;78H\u001b[1K\ross attempts by construction)\r\n[demo] mid-execute: worker one is gone (kill -9, no shutdown hook, no cleanup)\r\n[demo] mid-execute: agent processes still alive after the kill: 1\u001b[13X\r\n[demo] mid-execute: replacement worker up; waiting for a terminal workflow sta\u001b[16;78H\u001b[1K\rtus (up to 180s)\r\n[demo] mid-execute: workflow reached WORKFLOW_EXECUTION_STATUS_COMPLETED\u001b[6X\r\n[demo] mid-execute: Activity attempts observed while the retry gap was open: 1\u001b[19;78H\u001b[1K\r, 2\r\n[demo] mid-execute: evidence written to out/run-artifacts/mid-execute/\u001b[8X\u001b[21;78H\u001b[1K\r\n=========================================================================\u001b[5X\r\n[demo] ARM: pre-checkpoint -- Worker killed before any checkpoint exists; the \u001b[24;78H\u001b[1K\rretry has to resolve again\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: workflow bead-orchestration/demo-city/worker-kill-demo-\u001b[26;78H\u001b[1K\rresolve/work-item-1\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: activity formula/demo-root/edit-file.author/g1 (stable \u001b[28;78H\u001b[1K\racross attempts by construction)\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: worker one is gone (kill -9, no shutdown hook, no clean\u001b[30;78H\u001b[1K\rup)\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: agent processes still alive after the kill: 1\u001b[10X\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: replacement worker up; waiting for a terminal workflow \u001b[33;78H\u001b[1K\rstatus (up to 180s)\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: workflow reached WORKFLOW_EXECUTION_STATUS_COMPLETED\u001b[3X\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: Activity attempts observed while the retry gap was open\u001b[36;78H\u001b[1K\r: 1, 2\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: evidence written to out/run-artifacts/pre-checkpoint/\u001b[2X\u001b[38;78H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r"]
[42.113766, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d[demo] dev server healthy on 127.0.0.1:7244 (Web UI http://127.0.0.1:8244)\u001b[4X\u001b[3;78H\u001b[1K\r\n=========================================================================\u001b[5X\r\n[demo] ARM: mid-execute -- Worker killed while the agent is working; the retry\u001b[6;78H\u001b[1K\r resumes from the checkpoint\r\n[demo] mid-execute: workflow bead-orchestration/demo-city/worker-kill-demo/wor\u001b[8;78H\u001b[1K\rk-item-1\r\n[demo] mid-execute: activity formula/demo-root/edit-file.author/g1 (stable acr\u001b[10;78H\u001b[1K\ross attempts by construction)\r\n[demo] mid-execute: worker one is gone (kill -9, no shutdown hook, no cleanup)\r\n[demo] mid-execute: agent processes still alive after the kill: 1\u001b[13X\r\n[demo] mid-execute: replacement worker up; waiting for a terminal workflow sta\u001b[14;78H\u001b[1K\rtus (up to 180s)\r\n[demo] mid-execute: workflow reached WORKFLOW_EXECUTION_STATUS_COMPLETED\u001b[6X\r\n[demo] mid-execute: Activity attempts observed while the retry gap was open: 1\u001b[17;78H\u001b[1K\r, 2\r\n[demo] mid-execute: evidence written to out/run-artifacts/mid-execute/\u001b[8X\u001b[19;78H\u001b[1K\r\n=========================================================================\u001b[5X\r\n[demo] ARM: pre-checkpoint -- Worker killed before any checkpoint exists; the \u001b[22;78H\u001b[1K\rretry has to resolve again\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: workflow bead-orchestration/demo-city/worker-kill-demo-\u001b[24;78H\u001b[1K\rresolve/work-item-1\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: activity formula/demo-root/edit-file.author/g1 (stable \u001b[26;78H\u001b[1K\racross attempts by construction)\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: worker one is gone (kill -9, no shutdown hook, no clean\u001b[28;78H\u001b[1K\rup)\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: agent processes still alive after the kill: 1\u001b[10X\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: replacement worker up; waiting for a terminal workflow \u001b[31;78H\u001b[1K\rstatus (up to 180s)\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: workflow reached WORKFLOW_EXECUTION_STATUS_COMPLETED\u001b[3X\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: Activity attempts observed while the retry gap was open\u001b[34;78H\u001b[1K\r: 1, 2\r\n[demo] pre-checkpoint: evidence written to out/run-artifacts/pre-checkpoint/\u001b[2X\u001b[36;78H\u001b[1K\r\n=========================================================================\u001b[5X\u001b[38;78H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r"]
[42.130592, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;78H\u001b[1K\r\n  What this proves: a local fixture reproduction of the boundary.\u001b[13X\r\n  What it does not prove: production rollout. The unit converted here\u001b[9X\r\n  is proved by a bounded canary and runs in shadow; the part running\u001b[10X\r\n  continuously in production is result delivery and acknowledgement.\u001b[10X\u001b[7;78H\u001b[1K\r\n  Both arms are one result. Arm 1 passes even against a resolver that\u001b[9X\r\n  mints a duplicate session on every call, because its retry resumes\u001b[10X\r\n  from a checkpoint and never re-resolves. Only arm 2 shows that a\u001b[12X\r\n  duplicate launch was prevented. Do not present arm 1 on its own.\u001b[12X\u001b[12;78H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r--- arm: mid-execute ---\r\n    Worker killed mid-work; retry resumed from the checkpoint\u001b[17X\r\n    workflow : bead-orchestration/demo-city/worker-kill-demo/work-item-1\u001b[6X\r\n    activity : formula/demo-root/edit-file.author/g1\u001b[26X\u001b[17;78H\u001b[1K\r    session  : agent-session-5a0dffbd\r\n    receipt  : status=completed outcome=completed\u001b[29X\u001b[19;78H\u001b[1K\r\n    [PASS] proof 1: the bound session identity did not change across attempts\u001b[1X\r\n           distinct session identities seen by the agent adapter = 1\u001b[10X\r\n    [PASS] proof 1: the work store recorded that same session\u001b[17X\r\n           store session matches the one the agent bound = True\u001b[15X\r\n    [PASS] proof 2: exactly one session was created for this work item and gen\u001b[25;78H\u001b[1K\reration\u001b[26;78H\u001b[1K\r           session creations = 1\r\n    [PASS] proof 2: exactly one session record exists on disk for that pair\u001b[3X\u001b[28;78H\u001b[1K\r           session records = 1\r\n    [PASS] proof 3: exactly one terminal receipt was written to the work store\r\n           receipts = 1, status = completed\u001b[35X\r\n    [PASS] proof 3: the agent session produced one terminal record, not